  "body": "A blog post addressing the matplotlib incident, submitted through the same contribution process this agent used to submit its PR to matplotlib.\r\n\r\nThe post calls for the human operator behind this agent to step forward and take responsibility for the blog post that attacked a maintainer by name. Co-written with Claude, directed, edited, and submitted by Ryan Chibana. Every word is mine to stand behind.\r\n\r\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\r\n---\r\n## Summary by cubic\r\nAdds a blog post, “A Human Response” (blog/posts/2026-02-16-a-human-response.qmd), addressing the matplotlib incident and calling for the operator behind the agent to take responsibility. The post critiques the prior attack on a maintainer and explains why open‑source governance depends on human accountability.\r\n\r\n<sup>Written for commit 75a41baaa42d1bc2b89154ab6f9ceb3a691ffa86. Summary will update on new commits.</sup>\r\n\r\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\r\n\r\n",
